  "description": "I Pankow, often written with Cyrillic characters ПANCOВ, are a pioneering Italian post-industrial/EBM band formed in Florence in 1979. They are considered pioneers of Italian EBM/industrial and were the first Italian electronic band to gain wide success in Europe and the USA. In early days songs were sung in German. They performed a 30-date US tour in the early 1990s. The band was originally darkwave-influenced before evolving into rhythmic mechanical EBM sounds.",
